      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here are four detailed personas to guide your marketing efforts. **The Global Collector** is a high-earning, well-traveled individual (35-55, diverse) who values heritage and exclusivity, often spending on rare art and bespoke tailoring. **The Modern Mogul** (30-45, often tech-adjacent) is driven by innovative ingredients, views scent as a statement of success, and consumes luxury through curated digital and exclusive experiences. **The Established Patron** (45+, predominantly established wealth) prefers timeless, understated luxury, valuing craftsmanship and tradition over fleeting trends, often enjoying cultural institutions. Finally, **The Affluent Achiever** (28-38, highly ambitious) is drawn to personal branding, seeing luxury scents as part of their aspiration journey, and is very active on aspirational social media platforms.",
