      "content": "these are a good start but a bit vague. for the budget allocation part, we really need more granular detail on the ethnic and cultural backgrounds for these groups. for example, when you say \"established wealth\" or \"global collector,\" are we looking at a primarily white/European demographic, or are there specific emerging markets or ethnic segments we should be focusing on for the luxury tier? i want to make sure we aren't miscalculating which cultural aesthetics resonate most with high-end consumers.",
